27| * accent color theme, working directory, notes directory,
28| * Git remote URL, and the per-project retry/timeout overrides.
29| * The form stays mounted across the project-related tabs (project, aliases,
30| * files-repos, addresses) so edits survive tab switches — the `section` prop only selects
31| * which blocks render. Dirty state is reported through `onDirtyChange` so
32| * the tab bar can warn before leaving with unsaved edits.
33| * @param {Object} props
